# A song over the 100-line limit. music.txt is tests/files/music-long: a song of 103 lines, then a short one.
# load_songs logged the long one and stopped reading it without setting its line count, so it never played, and
# read the rest of its lyrics as the next songs' artists and names (#63). Now it keeps the first 100 lines, skips
# to the song's closing ~, and reads the short song as it is. Smokegod lists the jukebox's songs, by name and by
# artist, and plays the long one.
@updates area,song
@place music-long music.txt
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@obj 3200 3001
play list
play list artist
play long
@pulse 72
